<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Souza Cruz 1996 net soars.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Souza Cruz 1996 net soars.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian tobacco producer Companhia Souza Cruz Industria e Comercio has released the following 1996 earnings figures.</p>
<p>			     1996		  1995</p>
<p>    Net		 349 million	 249 million</p>
<p>    Shr		 1.14		  0.81</p>
<p>    Gross Revs	6.036 bln	   5.116 bln</p>
<p>    Net Revs	  1.782 bln	   1.472 bln</p>
<p>Note: The figures are all in Brazlian reais and are not inflation-adjusted.</p>
</text>
